#: ../../settings_kb/interface/journals/features/formatters.rst:524
msgid "**locales**"
msgstr "**locales**"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/journals/features/formatters.rst
msgid "Какую локаль использовать для форматирования."
msgstr "Which locale to use for formatting."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/journals/features/formatters.rst
msgid ""
"От неё зависит, как будут разделяться тысячи и дробные числа (точкой, "
"запятой или пробелом). По умолчанию — текущая локаль."
msgstr ""
"It determines how thousands and decimal numbers are separated (by dot, "
"comma, or space). Default is the current locale."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/journals/features/formatters.rst:527
#: ../../settings_kb/interface/journals/features/formatters.rst:555
msgid "**maximumFractionDigits**"
msgstr "**maximumFractionDigits**"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/journals/features/formatters.rst:528
msgid "сколько чисел после запятой"
msgstr "number of decimal places"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/journals/features/formatters.rst:529
#: ../../settings_kb/interface/journals/features/formatters.rst:557
msgid "**decimalSeparator**"
msgstr "**decimalSeparator**"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/journals/features/formatters.rst:530
msgid "как отделяются дробные числа. По умолчанию зависит от локали"
msgstr "how decimal numbers are separated. Default depends on locale"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/journals/features/formatters.rst:531
#: ../../settings_kb/interface/journals/features/formatters.rst:559
msgid "**thousandSeparator**"
msgstr "**thousandSeparator**"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/journals/features/formatters.rst:532
msgid "как разделяются тысячи. По умолчанию зависит от локали."
msgstr "how thousands are separated. Default depends on locale."

